> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.

**Goal:** Add dual-view Summary tab (Quick Review + Detailed) with proper web rendering and paragraph-by-paragraph condensation.

**Architecture:** Quick Review uses existing summary generation modified to output JSON. Detailed uses streaming paragraph-by-paragraph condensation (like simplification). Both cached in Section model.

